            <div xml:id="d132-a3">

                <pb facs="0204" n="144" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg144"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of decree.</hi></head>
                <p>The Hellenic Parliament, in consideration of the generous sentiments which the
                    republic of the United States of America has always manifested for the Greek
                    nation, and moved by the humane and sympathetic words which have been uttered in
                    behalf of Crete by the two houses of Congress, expresses to these bodies, and
                    through them to the magnanimous people of America, its profound gratitude, and
                    confides to the president of the Hellenic Chamber the duty of transmitting this
                    national resolution.</p>
            </div>
